[{ "action": "append", "id": "event-modals", "value" : "<div tabindex=\"-1\" id=\"modal-d18dee3a-bd1b-403e-8b1f-52e0cabec5b7\" class=\"modal\"><div class=\"modal-dialog modal-lg\"><div class=\"modal-content\"><div class=\"modal-header\"><a data-dismiss=\"modal\" class=\"close\"><span class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-remove\"></span></a><p class=\"text-muted\"><span class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-road\"></span> Research Track</p><strong>Fri 17 Apr 2026 16:45 - 17:00 at <a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/room/icse-2026/icse-2026-venue-oceania-vi\" class=\"room-link navigate\">Oceania VI</a></strong> - <a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/track/icse-2026/icse-2026-software-engineering-education-and-training--seet-#program\" class=\"navigate\">Education 9</a> <small>Chair(s): <a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/profile/icse-2026/stephankrusche\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"navigate\">Stephan Krusche</a></small></div><div class=\"modal-body\"><div class=\"bg-primary event-title\"><h4><span data-event-star=\"d18dee3a-bd1b-403e-8b1f-52e0cabec5b7\" title=\"Add event to your program\"><span class=\"text-disabled glyphicon glyphicon-star-empty\"></span></span><strong>Same Same But Different: Preventing Refactoring Attacks on Software Plagiarism Detection</strong></h4></div><div class=\"bg-info event-description\"><p>Plagiarism detection in programming education faces growing challenges due to increasingly sophisticated obfuscation techniques, particularly automated refactoring-based attacks. While code plagiarism detection systems used in education practice are resilient against basic obfuscation, they struggle against structural modifications that preserve program behavior, especially caused by refactoring-based obfuscation. This paper presents a novel and extensible framework that enhances state-of-the-art detectors by leveraging code property graphs and graph transformations to counteract refactoring-based obfuscation. Our comprehensive evaluation of real-world student submissions, obfuscated using both algorithmic and AI-based obfuscation attacks, demonstrates a significant improvement in detecting plagiarized code.</p>\n<p></p><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2510.25057\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"publication-link navigate\"><span class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-link\"></span> Pre-print</a><p></p><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-sm-6\"><a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/profile/icse-2026/robinmaisch\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"navigate\"><div class=\"media\"><span class=\"pull-left\"><img alt=\"Robin Maisch\" src=\"https://conf.researchr.org/getProfileImage/robinmaisch/94c8b244-38bb-4053-bdd7-76d9b5098a68/micro-avatar?1783979383000\" class=\"outputimage media-object thumbnail no-bottom-margin\"/></span><div class=\"media-body\"><h5 class=\"media-heading\">Robin Maisch<span class=\"pull-right\"><small></small></span></h5><h5 class=\"media-heading\"><span class=\"text-black\">Karlsruhe Institute of Technology (KIT)</span></h5><h5 class=\"media-heading\"><small>Germany</small></h5></div></div></a></div><div class=\"col-sm-6\"><a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/profile/icse-2026/larissaschmid\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"navigate\"><div class=\"media\"><span class=\"pull-left\"><img alt=\"Larissa Schmid\" src=\"https://conf.researchr.org/getProfileImage/larissaschmid/8a144c92-aa62-4d50-80e4-bdb07592e5c6/micro-avatar?1783978741000\" class=\"outputimage media-object thumbnail no-bottom-margin\"/></span><div class=\"media-body\"><h5 class=\"media-heading\">Larissa Schmid<span class=\"pull-right\"><small></small></span></h5><h5 class=\"media-heading\"><span class=\"text-black\">KTH Royal Institute of Technology</span></h5></div></div></a></div></div><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-sm-6\"><a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/profile/icse-2026/timursaglam\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"navigate\"><div class=\"media\"><span class=\"pull-left\"><img alt=\"Timur Sa\u011Flam\" src=\"https://conf.researchr.org/getProfileImage/timursaglam/50032c90-a516-48e3-870f-8dde55dbf3d7/micro-avatar?1783980876000\" class=\"outputimage media-object thumbnail no-bottom-margin\"/></span><div class=\"media-body\"><h5 class=\"media-heading\">Timur Sa\u011Flam<span class=\"pull-right\"><small></small></span></h5><h5 class=\"media-heading\"><span class=\"text-black\">Karlsruhe Institute of Technology (KIT)</span></h5><h5 class=\"media-heading\"><small>Germany</small></h5></div></div></a></div><div class=\"col-sm-6\"><a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/profile/icse-2026/nilsniehues\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"navigate\"><div class=\"media\"><span class=\"pull-left\"><img alt=\"Nils Niehues\" src=\"https://conf.researchr.org/getProfileImage/nilsniehues/98475d0a-e1d7-4dcc-a298-903e4aa88ae5/micro-avatar?1783974489000\" class=\"outputimage media-object thumbnail no-bottom-margin\"/></span><div class=\"media-body\"><h5 class=\"media-heading\">Nils Niehues<span class=\"pull-right\"><small></small></span></h5><h5 class=\"media-heading\"><span class=\"text-black\">Karlsruhe Institute of Technology (KIT)</span></h5></div></div></a></div></div></div><br></div><div class=\"modal-footer\"><span class=\"pull-left\"><a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/details/icse-2026/icse-2026-research-track/183/Same-Same-But-Different-Preventing-Refactoring-Attacks-on-Software-Plagiarism-Detect\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"btn btn-default navigate\"><span class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-new-window\"></span> All Details</a></span><a href=\"#\" data-dismiss=\"modal\" class=\"btn btn-default\"><span class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-remove\"></span> Close</a></div></div></div></div>"},{ "action": "runscript", "value": "$('#modal-d18dee3a-bd1b-403e-8b1f-52e0cabec5b7').modal({ backdrop: 'static', keyboard: true}, 'show');" },
